{{!-- Posting the item to chat from its own sheet.

The same act the inventory popover offers, in the one place a sheet that is
already open can reach it. It is deliberately not gated on `canEdit`: an item
opened out of the locked gear compendium is read-only, and that is exactly the
case this button exists for — the GM shows the party what a piece is without
first unlocking the pack or copying the item anywhere. --}}
<div class='item-post-row'>
  <a class='item-post-chat' title='{{localize "TNO.Item.Overview.Post"}}' tabindex='0'>
    <i class='fa-solid fa-message'></i>
    <span>{{localize 'TNO.Item.Overview.Post'}}</span>
  </a>
</div>
